# Environment variables you can set for the local server and the build.
#
# NOTE: nothing in this project auto-loads .env. There is no dotenv
# dependency and no process.loadEnvFile() call anywhere in scripts/ or the app.
# Copying this file to .env does NOTHING by itself. A variable below only
# takes effect if YOU export it into the shell's environment before running a
# command, e.g. (bash) `GCA_PORT=9000 node scripts/server.js`, or
# (PowerShell) `$env:GCA_PORT=9000; node scripts/server.js`.
#
# None of these is a secret, and every one is optional. The switches the test
# suite uses are documented in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md (Testing), not here.

# Port for the local server (default 8765); change it if 8765 is already taken.
# GCA_PORT=8765

# Folder for your archive and wizard files instead of ./personal_data (absolute path OUTSIDE this repo).
# GCA_PERSONAL=/absolute/path/outside/this/repo
#
# Hazard: do NOT point GCA_PERSONAL at a folder INSIDE the repo (e.g.
# ./my_data). Only the default personal_data/ (and personal_data*/) is covered
# by .gitignore and eslint's ignore list. A relocated in-repo folder's
# config.json, local.js, pfps/ and media/ are NOT ignored, so `git add .` would
# commit real names and photos.

# Set to 1 to print the stack trace when a build fails unexpectedly (for bug reports).
# GCA_DEBUG=1
